// COSMIC system actions. cosmic-settings-config reads the system defaults from
// /usr/share/cosmic/com.system76.CosmicSettings.Shortcuts/v1/system_actions
// first, then `extend`s them with this file, so only the entries we actually
// want to change belong here -- everything else (volume, brightness,
// screenshot, launcher, ...) keeps its upstream command.
//
// Terminal is what Super+T (System(Terminal) in the default keybinds) runs.
// cosmic-files' "Open Terminal" does not read this; it resolves the
// x-scheme-handler/terminal mime default instead, which points at
// kitty.desktop in ~/.config/mimeapps.list.
{
    Terminal: "kitty",
}
